@inherits RazorBlade.HtmlTemplate
@*
  The widget's shared stylesheet, written once and included by every page.

  A partial rather than a wrapper helper: it is an ordinary RazorBlade template, so it composes the
  way any other view does, a page that wants more adds its own <style> after it, and there is
  nothing to close.

  Selectors are prefixed because a widget's CSS is global to the dashboard page. Whether the console
  isolates each widget is unverified - AWS's own samples write bare `td { }`, which only works if it
  does - so this assumes it does not.
*@
<style>
  .w-meta { color: #687078; font-size: 12px; margin: 4px 0; }
  .w-empty { color: #687078; font-style: italic; }
</style>
